[node name="River" type="Node3D" parent="Ground" unique_id=944551148]

; In the `water_surface` group so that opaque effects can ask where the waterline is
; without knowing anything about this level. actors/player/water_line.gd explains
; why they have to: this surface is `blend_mix`, so it erases an opaque effect's fill
; without writing depth, and the outline pass then contours a shape that is not
; visibly there. The group is the whole of the coupling.
